        "PMC12842692::web::019::3_3_difference_in_creep_resistance_betwe",
        "PMC12842692::web::031::4_conclusions"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "The proposed coatings contain alternating coherent γ and γ′ phases with defined phase boundaries.",
